<title>USA: Nabi starts Phase II hepatitis trial.</title>
<headline>Nabi starts Phase II hepatitis trial.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nabi Inc said Tuesday it has begun a Phase II trial of H-BIG five percent intravenous formulation for the prevention of hepatitis B infection in liver transplant patients.</p>
<p>Nabi said the Phase II study will define the design of a pivotal trial and expects these studies to be completed over the next year.</p>
</text>
